// A mixed group marches across open ground, through a narrow passage and on to a
// goal behind it, as one formation (WP4.6, docs/rules/formations.md). The map is
// assets/maps/formation, a flat 112 by 48 cell map made by
// `cargo run -p sf_headless --example gen_formation_map -- assets/maps/formation`:
//
//   x 0..39          x 40..47               x 48..111
//   the west field   a wall of rock, every  the east field
//   (open ground)    row, with a passage    (open ground)
//                    in rows 22..24 (three
//                    cells wide, eight long)
//
// The 20 units stand on a block of 4 by 5 cells (x 6..9, y 20..24), one to a cell, and
// get ONE move order on tick 1: go to (100, 23), 91 cells east and behind the passage.
// The slots are the entity ids; every row mixes the three speeds:
//
//   10 riflemen (foot, 0.7 cells a second)   5 light tanks (tracked, 2)
//    5 light transports (wheeled, 2.5)
//
// All three cross the same ground, so the order makes ONE formation of 20: the group
// keeps its shape in the open field, the slowest (a rifleman) sets the pace, the
// formation breaks up at the passage, the units file through, and it forms up again on
// the other side. The riflemen are 10, at least the flowfield threshold (8), so they
// follow a field; the 5 tanks and 5 transports are below it and have routes of their own.
//
// tools/sf_headless/tests/formation_move.rs asserts the shape in the open field (every
// unit near its slot for nearly all of the ticks there), the pace (the group is never
// strung out along its heading by more than its own extent while it is in formation, and
// takes about as long as the slowest alone would), that the formation is whole again after
// the passage, that all of them arrive and none is stuck, and the overlap bounds of
// phase 4. CI runs the scenario on Linux and Windows and requires the checksum in
// formation_move.expected. `unit_defs` is the frozen copy of the definitions `pathing`
// uses, so a rebalance of assets/config/ does not move the checksum.

Scenario(
    name: "formation_move",
    seed: 0x7E44_0046,
    map: (width: 112, height: 48),
    map_name: Some("formation"),
    unit_defs: Some("pathing_defs"),
    ticks: 4200,
    commands: [
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 12, owner: 0, cell: (6, 20))), // slot 0: rifleman
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 19, owner: 0, cell: (7, 20))), // slot 1: light tank
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 12, owner: 0, cell: (8, 20))), // slot 2: rifleman
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 24, owner: 0, cell: (9, 20))), // slot 3: light transport
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 19, owner: 0, cell: (6, 21))), // slot 4: light tank
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 12, owner: 0, cell: (7, 21))), // slot 5: rifleman
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 24, owner: 0, cell: (8, 21))), // slot 6: light transport
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 12, owner: 0, cell: (9, 21))), // slot 7: rifleman
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 12, owner: 0, cell: (6, 22))), // slot 8: rifleman
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 24, owner: 0, cell: (7, 22))), // slot 9: light transport
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 12, owner: 0, cell: (8, 22))), // slot 10: rifleman
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 19, owner: 0, cell: (9, 22))), // slot 11: light tank
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 24, owner: 0, cell: (6, 23))), // slot 12: light transport
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 12, owner: 0, cell: (7, 23))), // slot 13: rifleman
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 19, owner: 0, cell: (8, 23))), // slot 14: light tank
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 12, owner: 0, cell: (9, 23))), // slot 15: rifleman
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 12, owner: 0, cell: (6, 24))), // slot 16: rifleman
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 19, owner: 0, cell: (7, 24))), // slot 17: light tank
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 12, owner: 0, cell: (8, 24))), // slot 18: rifleman
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 24, owner: 0, cell: (9, 24))), // slot 19: light transport

        // --- tick 1: one order for everybody ---
        (tick: 1, command: OrderMove(ids: [Range(0, 20)], target: (100, 23))),
    ],
)
